==Notes==

It is a good idea to separate your rams from your ewes, to ensure that you can select the highest quality ram to mate with your ewes when you want lambs.
*''Note: Although the game has some auto-naming for newborns, with different names for male and female. This is however not the case with sheep. Both male and female sheep's are initially named "Dolly", so make sure to check (and rename when needed)''.

